   "id": "aula",
   "tipo": "aula",
   "titulo": "Aula",
   "instrucao": "Clique em 🔊 para ouvir.",
   "html": "\n<p>Em francês, adjetivos <strong>e</strong> substantivos têm gênero e número. O adjetivo concorda com o substantivo.</p>\n<h3>Como o feminino se forma</h3>\n<div class=\"tabela-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Padrão</th><th>Masculino</th><th>Feminino</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>regra geral: +e</td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"grand\">grand</span></td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"grande\">grande</span></td></tr><tr><td>-eux → -euse</td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"heureux\">heureux</span></td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"heureuse\">heureuse</span></td></tr><tr><td>-f → -ve</td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"actif\">actif</span></td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"active\">active</span></td></tr><tr><td>-er → -ère</td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"premier\">premier</span></td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"première\">première</span></td></tr><tr><td>-on → -onne</td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"bon\">bon</span></td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"bonne\">bonne</span></td></tr><tr><td>-en → -enne</td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"ancien\">ancien</span></td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"ancienne\">ancienne</span></td></tr><tr><td>-eur → -euse</td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"travailleur\">travailleur</span></td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"travailleuse\">travailleuse</span></td></tr><tr><td>-teur → -trice</td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"acteur\">acteur</span></td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"actrice\">actrice</span></td></tr><tr><td>-c → -que</td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"public\">public</span></td><td><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"publique\">publique</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"destaque\"><strong>Irregulares:</strong> <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"beau\">beau</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"belle\">belle</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"nouveau\">nouveau</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"nouvelle\">nouvelle</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"vieux\">vieux</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"vieille\">vieille</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"blanc\">blanc</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"blanche\">blanche</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"long\">long</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"longue\">longue</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"doux\">doux</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"douce\">douce</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"gentil\">gentil</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"gentille\">gentille</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"faux\">faux</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"fausse\">fausse</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"frais\">frais</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"fraîche\">fraîche</span></div>\n<p><strong>Unissex</strong> (já terminam em -e): jeune, riche, calme, facile, difficile, rouge, sympathique, moderne; e substantivos como un/une élève, artiste, collègue.</p>\n<h3>Quando o substantivo muda de palavra</h3><p><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"un homme\">un homme</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"une femme\">une femme</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"un père\">un père</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"une mère\">une mère</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"un frère\">un frère</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"une sœur\">une sœur</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"un roi\">un roi</span> → <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"une reine\">une reine</span></p>\n<h3>O plural</h3>\n<ul><li>Regra geral +s: <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"grands\">grands</span>, <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"intéressantes\">intéressantes</span></li><li>Terminado em -s, -x, -z: não muda: <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"gros\">gros</span>, <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"heureux\">heureux</span></li><li>-eau → -eaux: <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"beaux\">beaux</span>, <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"nouveaux\">nouveaux</span></li><li>-al → -aux: <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"nationaux\">nationaux</span>, <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"originaux\">originaux</span></li></ul>\n<h3>Intensidade</h3>\n<p><span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"très beau\">très beau</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"vraiment intéressant\">vraiment intéressant</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"si difficile\">si difficile</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"tellement content\">tellement content</span> · <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"extrêmement rare\">extrêmement rare</span></p>\n<div class=\"dica\">Adjetivos que já são intensos (excellent, magnifique, extraordinaire, formidable, superbe) não levam <em>très</em>: <span class=\"fr\" data-fr=\"C'est excellent !\">C'est excellent !</span></div>"
  },
